{"kp_id": "zj-017.kp0001", "video_id": "zj-017", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "合谷处有动脉，进针以指甲切拨避脉；勿贴骨缘，免伤骨膜剧痛。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.li4"], "chapter_id": "zj-017.c01", "evidence_quote": "有脉的地方，指甲切一下，尽量避开脉下针", "seg_from": 8, "seg_to": 10, "start_s": 37.21, "end_s": 70.965, "citation": {"youtube_id": "aBoNsXGlT6Q", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aBoNsXGlT6Q&t=37s", "series": "zj", "episode": 17, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 17", "start_s": 37.21, "end_s": 70.97}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-017.kp0002", "video_id": "zj-017", "type": "contraindication", "statement": "怀孕时合谷一般不下针；医书谓孕妇可泻不可补。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.li4"], "chapter_id": "zj-017.c01", "evidence_quote": "怀孕的时候，合谷不要下针", "seg_from": 15, "seg_to": 18, "start_s": 88.95, "end_s": 122.44, "citation": {"youtube_id": "aBoNsXGlT6Q", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aBoNsXGlT6Q&t=88s", "series": "zj", "episode": 17, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 17", "start_s": 88.95, "end_s": 122.44}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "可卸=可泻", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-017.kp0003", "video_id": "zj-017", "type": "concept_definition", "statement": "手三阳经气自四肢末梢上行；合谷顺经针刺为补，逆经为泻。", "entity_ids": ["meridian.li", "acupoint.li4", "method.bu_xie"], "chapter_id": "zj-017.c01", "evidence_quote": "如果顺着血下增，是不是就叫做补", "seg_from": 17, "seg_to": 18, "start_s": 101.59, "end_s": 122.44, "citation": {"youtube_id": "aBoNsXGlT6Q", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aBoNsXGlT6Q&t=101s", "series": "zj", "episode": 17, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 17", "start_s": 101.59, "end_s": 122.44}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "血下增=向下针", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-017.kp0004", "video_id": "zj-017", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "临产阵痛时若合谷脉动上窜，提示即将分娩；合谷气脉通于胞宫，亦可作诊断。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.li4"], "chapter_id": "zj-017.c01", "evidence_quote": "合谷是气脉之所在，直接通到子宫", "seg_from": 33, "seg_to": 36, "start_s": 206.34, "end_s": 231.045, "citation": {"youtube_id": "aBoNsXGlT6Q", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aBoNsXGlT6Q&t=206s", "series": "zj", "episode": 17, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 17", "start_s": 206.34, "end_s": 231.04}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-017.kp0005", "video_id": "zj-017", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "双手合谷配双足太冲，合称开四关。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.li4", "acupoint.lr3"], "chapter_id": "zj-017.c02", "evidence_quote": "下针两个合谷穴，下两个太宗", "seg_from": 88, "seg_to": 89, "start_s": 468.18, "end_s": 480.825, "citation": {"youtube_id": "aBoNsXGlT6Q", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aBoNsXGlT6Q&t=468s", "series": "zj", "episode": 17, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 17", "start_s": 468.18, "end_s": 480.82}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "太宗=太冲；绞落=开四关/交络", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-017.kp0006", "video_id": "zj-017", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "偏历为手阳明络穴；温溜约在偏历上两寸大肠经上。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.li6", "acupoint.li7", "concept.luo_xue"], "chapter_id": "zj-017.c02", "evidence_quote": "偏力穴呢是首阳明的络穴", "seg_from": 111, "seg_to": 128, "start_s": 572.68, "end_s": 667.32, "citation": {"youtube_id": "aBoNsXGlT6Q", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aBoNsXGlT6Q&t=572s", "series": "zj", "episode": 17, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 17", "start_s": 572.68, "end_s": 667.32}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "偏力=偏历；首阳明=手阳明；温流=温溜", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-017.kp0007", "video_id": "zj-017", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "上半身皮肤瘙痒，曲池与合谷为常用止痒穴；可配上巨虚（肺与大肠表里）。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.li11", "acupoint.li4", "acupoint.st37"], "chapter_id": "zj-017.c02", "evidence_quote": "曲池跟合谷两个是最有名的止痒皮肤止养穴", "seg_from": 212, "seg_to": 220, "start_s": 1105.98, "end_s": 1163.255, "citation": {"youtube_id": "aBoNsXGlT6Q", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aBoNsXGlT6Q&t=1105s", "series": "zj", "episode": 17, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 17", "start_s": 1105.98, "end_s": 1163.26}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "止养=止痒", "source": "llm_read"}
